{"schemaVersion":"galpedia-static-detail-model-v1","dataRevision":"a0c0367b8270b080feef0ef1fe65522144dc62343feb9d752729d92867d0d639","workId":"7430","model":{"presentationWorkId":"vndb:v7543","staff":{"artwork":[{"creditedName":"つたえゆず","creatorId":"vndb:s9166","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:2798","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s9166","name":"つたえゆず","roleCode":"artwork","roleLabel":"原画","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:16558","source":"egs"}],"scenario":[{"creditedName":"つたえゆず","creatorId":"vndb:s9166","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:2798","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s9166","name":"つたえゆず","roleCode":"scenario","roleLabel":"剧本","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:16559","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"沢城利穂","creatorId":"vndb:s14028","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:2926","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s14028","name":"沢城利穂","roleCode":"scenario","roleLabel":"剧本","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:16560","source":"egs"}],"music":[{"creditedName":"水月陵(KIYO)","creatorId":"vndb:s803","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:2808","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s803","name":"水月陵(KIYO)","roleCode":"music","roleLabel":"作品音乐","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:16561","source":"egs"}],"other":[{"creditedName":"つたえ ゆず","creatorId":"vndb:s9166","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s9166","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s9166","name":"つたえ ゆず","roleCode":"chardesign","roleLabel":"角色设计","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:71556","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_vndb_c124563","characterName":"夜","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c124563"},"originalCharacterName":"夜","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The other personality in Sora who was created to protect both he and Ran. He seems to be able to manipulate Sora's emotions, memories, and even his five senses. He only shows up when teasing Sora, when he's in a pinch, or when he wants to take care of Ran."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"His personality is inspired by Shin'ichirou, who Sora admired as a child. However, because he is an embodiment of Sora's admiration for him, he is more flawless than Shin'ichirou and has an unrealistic side to him."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Contrary to the simple Sora, he is always relaxed and does not show his true feelings. He is always smiling, playing games, and flirting with Sora. Ran is the most important person in his life, but he also seems to be very fond of Sora. After meeting Sora in the spirit world, he is able to communicate with him in his mind."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from official bio"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c124563"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5b/5bbcc4acd4e320f881c6926201c565f697b08ced29a9297f99514912d9654ccb.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7c/7c060af76588f3fed01bf7f8f31ed9b0fa2e5e58c2cb49905b9af374435cd2ca.webp","width":226,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"子安 武人","creatorId":"vndb:s10","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s10","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s10","name":"子安 武人","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:40207","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c124565","characterName":"椎名 廉","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c124565"},"originalCharacterName":"椎名 廉","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"219"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is a beautiful boy who transferred to Sei and Fuuta's class. He loves chemistry, and he transferred to this school because he admires Gaku, who is in the university club, but he is disappointed to find out that the chemistry club does not exist."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is the most beautiful boy in the school, but he does not make a good impression on those around him because of his cold, inaccessible atmosphere. However, once he has gotten to know a person, he is very open and honest with them."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is especially obedient to Gaku, whom he admires."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c124565"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/76/76075acdffe8ca185652042fd8df71d0f49b24ff14491cc9c13ca34dd537c01c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bc/bc9df275963ffb59ecbbba83dfeb465ea878cb31ee4a3ff9a1d9a899f5eb0f2a.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"高城 元気","creatorId":"vndb:s487","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s487","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s487","name":"高城元気","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:40217","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c124566","characterName":"青","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c124566"},"originalCharacterName":"青","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"419"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is cheerful, innocent, and has a sweet tooth. He is popular in class and is loved by everyone, especially his classmates Fuuta and Ren."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"A clone of Sora created by Aizawa."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Although he possesses athletic abilities unthinkable for an ordinary person, he was abandoned as a failure by Aizawa because he had no social skills at the time of his discovery. However, after repeated training under Sora's supervision, he was able to acquire age-appropriate (?) social skills."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"He is now enrolled in the school as Sora's younger brother and lives in the dormitory where Sora used to live."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c124566"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/37/3767a939cae3c947bdf5bda1ca41d54f3e1bd869767a22ca83bdc30af7e23489.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/97/972182e3d91ee3a3ffc2fc8cbc58ab457f7512620932da024af03ad1a8ea0bbe.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"小松 里歌","creatorId":"vndb:s7528","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s7528","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s7528","name":"小松里歌(小松里賀)","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:40224","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c124567","characterName":"北村 風太","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c124567"},"originalCharacterName":"北村 風太","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"331"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is an energetic boy who used to make requests to the sky. He loves sports and is always cheerful, frequently running around like a puppy. Although he does not belong to any clubs, he is a valued member of sports clubs as a helper."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He often breaks things because he can't stay still for even a few moments, but thanks to his easygoing personality, he doesn't get in trouble that much."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"He is very spoiled by his brother, Yoshihiro, who really loves him and takes care of him whenever possible."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c124567"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/19/191133537a7ed32ac01efdba83b305d32f4bf6419360330dabaf5e77cc622617.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/42/42c49ac5254353c2b6ebcbb79ca3f0225a96150ad6b28f5013777120306e980b.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"大本 眞基子","creatorId":"vndb:s617","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s617","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s617","name":"大本 眞基子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:40218","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c124568","characterName":"浅香 奏司","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c124568"},"originalCharacterName":"浅香 奏司","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"124"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is Shinichiro's older brother and a legal advisor to the detective agency."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is cold, calculating, and manipulative, but his soft-spoken manner makes people around him unaware of it."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He loves to bully Shinichiro and seems to be in a secret dispute with Nanami."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c124568"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fe/fedad8bb0fbd11116906ebcb22f1ae1690b428c422067e05e53e8770271bdaa7.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ef/ef85d3db974317e452280de4ed640ac456d02458e04c2fe4a82e519ec95befdc.webp","width":220,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"うえだ ゆうじ","creatorId":"vndb:s1443","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1443","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1443","name":"うえだ ゆうじ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:40222","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c124580","characterName":"中原 キリト","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c124580"},"originalCharacterName":"中原 キリト","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"201"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Kirito is a famous model and a laboratory assistant of Aizawa. The only reason Kirito works for himis to get closer to his son, Kai Nagase, whom he is in love with. Like Aizawa and Nagase, Kirito also disdains Ren Shiina."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is well known for his frequent mental freak outs and love for sharp objects."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Sukisho Wiki"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c124580"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bf/bfc40faa7ab02bdd214f56ee0c43ca1548cae348c2288d68e2f086834e37751d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e9/e9b448750c4fd45e1cab5a83794e01584e383c224a2ce7387a48330c7e46a0a3.webp","width":228,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"飛田 展男","creatorId":"vndb:s351","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s351","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s351","name":"飛田 展男","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:40213","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c2207","characterName":"羽柴 空","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c2207"},"originalCharacterName":"羽柴 空","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"321"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Sora is a student at an all-boys' high school, and a member of the school \"Nandemoya\" (Jack-of-All-Trades) team. He has lots of friends among the student body, but is also a target for rumors, especially after his mysterious fall though the upper-floor window of one of the school buildings, which left him hospitalized. He has no memories of his childhood, including his new roommate, Sunao, who he is told is his childhood friend. He decides he is going to find out why he mysteriously fell and has lost memories."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Boys' Love Game Headquarters"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c2207"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/26/2638330e148654bcffc853b65fbbe523575db0f22d47bd7df8465ca72b979cf2.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cd/cd7113df2fd849d7ce081eb9b730da3649e3ca476cf2b822518da06aa05bde06.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"緑川 光","creatorId":"vndb:s73","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s73","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s73","name":"緑川 光","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:40208","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c2208","characterName":"藤守 直","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c2208"},"originalCharacterName":"藤守 直","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"312"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Sunao is a transfer student to the high school, who shows up as Sora's new roommate at the time that Sora is released from the hospital. He is a childhood friend of Sora and Matsuri, and also part of the school Nandemoya team with them. Since Sora has no recollection of who he is, Sunao turns very angry and cold against him. He also seems to have some strange quirks, such as hating medicine and having strange moments where his personality seems to change..."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Boy's Love Game Headquarters"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c2208"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2d/2db00dac80f7146c2043461088e400ddca26625af9f69ad7ba379dcc02ea3191.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7f/7f2569e9adf16f1ba81ff9d3b3912197c2b8632250d23faed6e3583e3b87ad44.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"保志 総一朗","creatorId":"vndb:s114","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s114","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s114","name":"保志総一朗","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:40210","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c2209","characterName":"本城 祭","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c2209"},"originalCharacterName":"本城 祭","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"221"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Matsuri is the vice-president of the student body and superintendent of the dormitory, and also the one behind the school Nandemoya team. He is a friend from childhood of both Sora and Sunao. He has a very sunny personality and is also a bit playfully devious, enjoying playing tricks or teasing Sora and Sunao. He has a hobby for photography and one never knows when they could end up on his film."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Boys' Love Game Headquarters"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c2209"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ba/ba7da1e97f50186cd9671c3e6c9ec0321b59f6903ea9fef04b08e873b23e2c9d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e2/e2e3426fe4fc8b0e651758f6527ce5e158c2100f563ab6f1dbe43f5eeeccc6ef.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"千葉 進歩","creatorId":"vndb:s400","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s400","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s400","name":"千葉 進歩","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:40215","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c2210","characterName":"佐倉 広夢","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c2210"},"originalCharacterName":"佐倉 広夢","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"913"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":true,"text":"A innocent and playful wandering spirit who possesses Sunao in order to get closer to Sora, whom he loves, stirring trouble in the process."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Edited from Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c2210"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/16/160605cd27e83ee4356ba9f8f05af3a70bc3c5b6c44c4034cd68465c02a5685f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/89/8934934c3c60121b785079d1a6edb4b843d74c6e9f834d12ce725f91bcc819a0.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"阪口 大助","creatorId":"vndb:s1674","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1674","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1674","name":"阪口 大助","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:40223","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c2211","characterName":"市川 学","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c2211"},"originalCharacterName":"市川 学","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"403"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Gaku is Sora's extremely bright and energetic under-classman. He's a member of the science club, and has a crush on Nagase, the club president."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Boys' Love Game Headquarters"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c2211"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f6/f6d2a41a5eb7f74f6e2f875a34596ef346da3a05d6003c46e2394522e422d124.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2c/2c577991a9d40bbc37dd9fea3443e801432ae44a1dbda58a6d033bbd9dba23f7.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"私市 淳","creatorId":"vndb:s420","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s420","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s420","name":"私市 淳","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:40216","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c2212","characterName":"七海 かい","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c2212"},"originalCharacterName":"七海 かい","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"1225"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Nanami is the school nurse and counselor at Sora's school. He is extremely friendly and caring, and is well liked by the student body. He is a housewife-type that enjoys cooking and cleaning, and is viewed by Sora as a mother-figure."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Boys' Love Game Headquarters"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c2212"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7c/7c5d48974fdc38423ada7e0644a1047a8b75cbebc515f2c7a5e309aebd498e0a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.d